---
title: PR Validation - Full Integration Test
---
flowchart TD
    subgraph "Stage 1: Compile (~10 min)"
        BUILD[build-xpp.yml<br/>Compile + Package]
    end

    subgraph "Stage 2: Integration Test (~4-5 hours)"
        PROV[Provision ephemeral<br/>sandbox environment<br/>+ branch tag]
        WAIT[Wait 3 hours<br/>Agentless server delay<br/>pool: server]
        POLL[Poll for readiness<br/>up to 60 min]
        COPY[Copy DB from<br/>known good source]
        DEPLOY[Deploy package<br/>to test environment]
        SYNC[Database<br/>synchronization]
        SYSTEST[SysTest suite<br/>optional]
        ODATA[OData smoke tests<br/>+ other tests<br/>optional]
        TEARDOWN[Delete test<br/>environment]
    end

    subgraph "Result"
        PASS[PR check passes<br/>Merge allowed]
        FAIL[PR check fails<br/>Merge blocked]
    end

    BUILD -->|artifact| PROV
    PROV --> WAIT
    WAIT --> POLL
    POLL --> COPY
    COPY --> DEPLOY
    DEPLOY --> SYNC
    SYNC --> ODATA
    ODATA --> SYSTEST
    SYSTEST -->|pass| PASS
    SYSTEST -->|fail| FAIL
    ODATA -->|fail| FAIL

    SYSTEST --> TEARDOWN
    FAIL --> TEARDOWN

    style BUILD fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#2196f3
    style PROV fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#9c27b0
    style POLL fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#9c27b0
    style COPY fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#9c27b0
    style DEPLOY fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#2196f3
    style SYNC fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ff9800
    style ODATA fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ff9800
    style SYSTEST fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ff9800
    style TEARDOWN fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#f44336
    style PASS fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#4caf50,stroke-width:2px
    style FAIL fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#f44336,stroke-width:2px
